('multiple_choice','Anki-IPC-3011','_____ are used to share routes within a single autonomous system (AS). (Choose one answer)','["A. clock rate bits-per-second", "B. S", "C. IGPs", "D. default"]','[2]',NULL,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class="explanation-rich-content">\n  <div class="expl-card correct-card">\n    <h4 class="section-title-correct">✓ Correct Answer:</h4>\n    <p><strong>IGPs</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class="expl-card concept-card">\n    <div class="section-title-concept">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards — IP Connectivity (CCNA / Day 24 Flashcards - Dynamic Routing)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>'),
