('multiple_choice','Anki-IPC-3275','Code _____ in the routing table indicates a static route. (Choose one answer)','["A. Broadcast", "B. area border routers (ABRs)", "C. S", "D. Frame Relay / X.25"]','[2]',NULL,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class="explanation-rich-content">\n  <div class="expl-card correct-card">\n    <h4 class="section-title-correct">✓ Correct Answer:</h4>\n    <p><strong>S</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class="expl-card concept-card">\n    <div class="section-title-concept">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards — IP Connectivity (CCNA / Day 11 (part 2) Flashcards - Static Routing)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>'),
('multiple_choice','Anki-IPC-3276','Configure a default route, specifying the next-hop IP: R1(config)# _____ (Choose one answer)','["A. ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 next-hop", "B. 120", "C. ip ospf authentication", "D. standby group-number preempt"]','[0]',NULL,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class="explanation-rich-content">\n  <div class="expl-card correct-card">\n    <h4 class="section-title-correct">✓ Correct Answer:</h4>\n    <p><strong>ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 next-hop</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class="expl-card concept-card">\n    <div class="section-title-concept">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards — IP Connectivity (CCNA / Day 11 (part 2) Flashcards - Static Routing)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>'),
('multiple_choice','Anki-IPC-3277','Static routes in which you specify only the _____ appear as directly-connected in the routing table. (Choose one answer)','["A. ip ospf process-id area area-id", "B. no auto-summary", "C. exit-interface", "D. AS-External"]','[2]',NULL,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class="explanation-rich-content">\n  <div class="expl-card correct-card">\n    <h4 class="section-title-correct">✓ Correct Answer:</h4>\n    <p><strong>exit-interface</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class="expl-card concept-card">\n    <div class="section-title-concept">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards — IP Connectivity (CCNA / Day 11 (part 2) Flashcards - Static Routing)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>'),
('multiple_choice','Anki-IPC-3278','A _____ route is often used to direct traffic to the Internet. (Choose one answer)','["A. 255", "B. default", "C. Point-to-point", "D. The most specific matching route"]','[1]',NULL,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class="explanation-rich-content">\n  <div class="expl-card correct-card">\n    <h4 class="section-title-correct">✓ Correct Answer:</h4>\n    <p><strong>default</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class="expl-card concept-card">\n    <div class="section-title-concept">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards — IP Connectivity (CCNA / Day 11 (part 2) Flashcards - Static Routing)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>'),
('multiple_choice','Anki-IPC-3279','In the routing table, the output " Gateway of last resort is not set " means _____ (Choose one answer)','["A. 224.0.0.9", "B. passive-interface default", "C. a default route has not been configured", "D. 1) a connected route 2) a local route"]','[2]',NULL,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class="explanation-rich-content">\n  <div class="expl-card correct-card">\n    <h4 class="section-title-correct">✓ Correct Answer:</h4>\n    <p><strong>a default route has not been configured</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class="expl-card concept-card">\n    <div class="section-title-concept">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards — IP Connectivity (CCNA / Day 11 (part 2) Flashcards - Static Routing)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>'),
('multiple_choice','Anki-IPC-3280','Code _____ in the routing table indicates a candidate default route. (Choose one answer)','["A. autonomous system (AS)", "B. eigrp router-id a.b.c.d", "C. *", "D. 110"]','[2]',NULL,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class="explanation-rich-content">\n  <div class="expl-card correct-card">\n    <h4 class="section-title-correct">✓ Correct Answer:</h4>\n    <p><strong>*</strong></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class="expl-card concept-card">\n    <div class="section-title-concept">📌 Source: Anki Flashcards — IP Connectivity (CCNA / Day 11 (part 2) Flashcards - Static Routing)</div>\n  </div>\n</div>'));
